{"id":"kaima","name":"Kaima","type":"deity","aliases":["Great Kaima","the kami of Far Corner's shrine"],"description":"A boar-headed kami once bonded to Chishiro, whose bond was broken by Tatsunari; he now sleeps in a shrine in Far Corner and awakens in rage.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2022-02-07","last_seen":"2022-02-07","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Blade Reflected and Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Emma Mieko Candon"],"date":"2022-02-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Blade Reflected and Reborn\" by Emma Mieko Candon. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Feb 2022."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07-e1","summary":"Chishiro warns the shrine's sleeping kami not to trouble the townsfolk further.","participants":["chishiro","kaima"],"location":"far-corner-shrine","importance":"minor","page":"stories/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","order":450,"story_date":"2022-02-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":19,"quote":"\"Don't trouble them more than you already have.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07#:~:text=%22Don%27t%20trouble%20them%20more%20than%20you%20already%20have.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Blade Reflected and Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Emma Mieko Candon"],"date":"2022-02-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/blade-reflected-and-reborn-2022-02-07#:~:text=%22Don%27t%20trouble%20them%20more%20than%20you%20already%20have.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Blade R